      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |MODEL MDLRDR
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |--
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- DATA: Defines parameters that are constant throughout the entire simulation.
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |DATA total_knt  {dflt: 200}
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- channel ID table
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- 1 = T_MAN
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- 2 = T_OPO
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- 3 = TRANSFORMER
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- 4 = ...
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- add more if needed
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |DATA channel_id {dflt: 1}
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- VAR: variable parameters that might change throought the execution
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- we ask for the curr_knt so we can later down the pipe, at the graph
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- properly reset the graph after reaching the end of the current KNT execution
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |VAR curr_knt
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- Input: defines the signals the model receives from the circuit or other model
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- wanted: Array that contains the values that you want to send to C subroutine
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |INPUT wanted[1..3]
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |INPUT i2
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |OUTPUT o1, o2
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |VAR o1,o2
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |INIT
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  o1:=0
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  o2:=1
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- The INIT procedure in MODELS (local) is used to create pre-simulation calculu
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- Here you can initialize internal variables, if necessary.
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |ENDINIT
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- Foregin Model Declaration (FOREIGN)
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- 'reader' its the local name that you are going to use in this file.
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- 'creader' its the NAME OF REGISTER that must be at refnam inside fgnmod.f
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- {ixdata:3, ixin:5, ixout:0, ixvar:4} defines the size of 4 interface arrays
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- ixin:5, we want 3 variables (3 phases) + t + current KNT
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |-- ixdata:3, we want the stoptime + total KNTs + channel_id
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |MODEL reader FOREIGN creader {ixdata:3, ixin:5, ixout:0, ixvar:3}
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |EXEC
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  -- here we assign the atp(KNT) to the current KNT
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  curr_knt := atp(KNT)
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  -- USE: Creates a instance ( a 'object') of the foreign model.
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  -- every 'USE' executes a corresponding C subroutine.
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  USE reader AS reader
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |    DATA
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      xdata[1] := total_knt
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      xdata[2] := stoptime
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      xdata[3] := channel_id
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |    INPUT
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      -- Passes the values 'wanted' to xin[1..3] of C subroutine.
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      xin[1..3] := wanted[1..3]
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      xin[4] := t
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      xin[5] := curr_knt
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  ENDUSE
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  o2 := t
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |ENDEXEC
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |ENDMODEL
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |USE MDLRDR AS DEFAULT
